  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Parabens</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Liquid Formula</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p ><strong>What it is: </strong>A long-wear lip stain that leaves lips with a flushed tint that enhances lip tone and has a transfer-proof formula that’s buildable and lightweight.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Formulation Type: </strong>Lip Tint </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong></p><p>- Ink-Dye Technology: Locks in weightless color that looks vibrant yet natural on the lips.</p><p>- Aloe Vera Gel: Supports lip barrier health, keeping lips soft and preventing dryness.</p><p>- Panthenol: Boosts shine and softness, hydrates lips, and improves barrier function.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts: </strong>This product is vegan and cruelty-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:</strong></p><p>-Remove any makeup or lip products and apply to clean, dry lips for best application and a long-lasting tint.</p><p>-Follow with your favorite lip liner for a defined look.</p><p>-Finish with your go-to lip product.</p><p>-Store tip down for the best application experience or to refresh felt tip. There's no need to shake.</p><p>-If you experience any clogging, gently rub the felt tip with a makeup wipe to remove any buildup.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p >-Ink-Dye Technology: Locks in weightless color that looks vibrant yet natural on the lips.</p><p>-Aloe Vera Gel: Supports lip barrier health, keeping lips soft and preventing dryness.</p><p>-Panthenol: Boosts shine and softness, hydrates lips, and improves barrier function.</p><p><br></p><p>Water/Aqua/Eau, Propylene Glycol, Alcohol, Hydrolyzed Corn Starch, Polyglyceryl-10 Laurate, Panthenol, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice, Caprylyl Glycol, Citric Acid, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, May Contain/Peut Contenir (+/-) Yellow 5 (Ci 19140), Red 28 (Ci 45410), Blue 1 (Ci 42090), Yellow 6 (Ci 15985), Red 33 (Ci 17200).</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;<em>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</em></p></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Parabens</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Liquid Formula</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p ><strong>What it is: </strong>A long-wear lip stain that leaves lips with a flushed tint that enhances lip tone and has a transfer-proof formula that’s buildable and lightweight.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Formulation Type: </strong>Lip Tint </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong></p><p>- Ink-Dye Technology: Locks in weightless color that looks vibrant yet natural on the lips.</p><p>- Aloe Vera Gel: Supports lip barrier health, keeping lips soft and preventing dryness.</p><p>- Panthenol: Boosts shine and softness, hydrates lips, and improves barrier function.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts: </strong>This product is vegan and cruelty-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:</strong></p><p>-Remove any makeup or lip products and apply to clean, dry lips for best application and a long-lasting tint.</p><p>-Follow with your favorite lip liner for a defined look.</p><p>-Finish with your go-to lip product.</p><p>-Store tip down for the best application experience or to refresh felt tip. There's no need to shake.</p><p>-If you experience any clogging, gently rub the felt tip with a makeup wipe to remove any buildup.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p >-Ink-Dye Technology: Locks in weightless color that looks vibrant yet natural on the lips.</p><p>-Aloe Vera Gel: Supports lip barrier health, keeping lips soft and preventing dryness.</p><p>-Panthenol: Boosts shine and softness, hydrates lips, and improves barrier function.</p><p><br></p><p>Water/Aqua/Eau, Propylene Glycol, Alcohol, Hydrolyzed Corn Starch, Polyglyceryl-10 Laurate, Panthenol, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice, Caprylyl Glycol, Citric Acid, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, May Contain/Peut Contenir (+/-) Yellow 5 (Ci 19140), Red 28 (Ci 45410), Blue 1 (Ci 42090), Yellow 6 (Ci 15985), Red 33 (Ci 17200).</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;<em>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</em></p></div></details>",
